{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-energy",
  "lexicon": "gkv",
  "number": 1287,
  "kind": "word",
  "headword": "energy",
  "ipa": [
    "ˈenədʒi"
  ],
  "levelMark": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "n.",
      "zh": "活力；精力；能量"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Living on campus enables students to devote more time and "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "energy"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " to their academic work."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "住校能使学生有更多的时间和精力投入到学业中。（松江）"
    }
  ],
  "compare": [
    {
      "words": "energy, force, power, strength",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "这四个词的含义都与“力”有关。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "energy"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 在物理学中是个重要术语，即“能”，包括动能和势能；在不作技术术语用时，它转化为功的“力”，可以表示“精力，体力”，还可表示“能量”和“能源”。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "As they grow old, people also accumulate belongings for two other reasons, lack of physical and mental "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "energy"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ", and sentiment. 当人到老年时，他们会为另外两个原因而积聚相关事物，其一为体力和脑力的不足，其二是感情因素。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "force"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 表示克服阻力或使物体运动所需要的力，或者说这种“力”是具有能力（power）的人或机械在工作时所显示的“力”（force）；一辆处于静止状态的完好的机车具有潜在的“力”（power），当它拖着满载货物的列车飞跑时，它便显示了自己克服阻力所需要的“力”（force）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Water streamed in torrents over its sides with such "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "force"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " that it set up a huge wave in the canal. 水从侧面溢出，其力量之大，致使运河翻起波澜。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "power"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 包括“能力”或“动力”。这种“力”可以是固有的，也可以是获得的；可以是潜在的，也可以是施展出来的；也可以是体力、脑力、精神的力量或机械力。在物理学中 power 指功率。当 power 的含义是“权力”或“职权”时，其同义词为 authority。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Experience teaches me that whatever "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "power"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " a fellow-guest may have to instruct or to amuse when he is sitting in a chair, or standing on a hearth-rug, quickly leaves him when he takes one out for a walk. 经验告诉我，无论哪个与我一同做客的人，当他坐在椅子里或站在炉前地毯上的时候，他可能具有教导或逗乐的精力；当他陪别人出去散步的时候，这种精力很快就不见了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "That all great art has this "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "power"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " of suggesting a world beyond is undeniable. 不可否认，一切伟大的艺术都具备使人有超尘脱俗的浮想的力量。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "strength"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 用作技术术语时，意思是“强度”。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "However, size and "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "strength"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " are not the only important things of this bridge. 然而桥的尺寸和强度并非其唯一重要的方面。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
